{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12375","headline":"晚出青门望终南别业 · 钱起","name":"晚出青门望终南别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能清谢朓思，暂下承明庐。\n远山新水下，寒臯微雨余。\n更怜归鸟去，宛到卧龙居。\n笑指丛林上，闲云自卷舒。\n宁心鸣凤日，却意钓璜初。\n处贵有余兴，伊周位不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}